Use the ``masks`` parameter of :class:`.ReHoMaps`, :class:`.ReHoParcels` and :class:`.ReHoSpheres` to restrict the ReHo computation for both ``using="junifer"`` and ``using="afni"``, instead of an MNI152 brain mask resampled to the input data (wrong for native space) only for ``using="junifer"``. Without ``masks``, both use the voxels with non-zero time series, so that both implementations give the same results by `Fede Raimondo`_
